<title>USA: FSF Financial buys back 173,884 shares.</title>
<headline>FSF Financial buys back 173,884 shares.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FSF Financial Corp said Tuesday it completed the repurchase of 173,884 shares of its common stock for a total of $2.3 million.</p>
<p>As a result of the purchase, the company now has 3,303,810 shares issued and outstanding.</p>
<p>FSF Financial is holding company of First Federal fsb.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
